# https://chrisacorns.computinghistory.org.uk/docs/Acorn/Tech/Acorn_A3xA4xVideoSpec.pdf
# Odd back/front porches redistributed by one pixel for VIDC20 even counts.
# 200/240-line variants centre the display in the same 312-line TV envelope.
# VGA/SVGA facts: VESA DMT v1.0 revision 10, pp.10,14,15:
# https://glenwing.github.io/docs/VESA-DMT-1.10.pdf
# VGA borders folded into porches: H back 48, front 16; V back 33, front 10.
# Each geometry supports all depths ScreenModes accepts (1/2/4/8/16/32 bpp).
# ScreenModes retains its hardware bandwidth and screen-capacity checks.
